    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34888" root="فوه" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاوُوهَةٌ</span></b>  A man <i>who reveals,</i> or <i>discloses, everything that is in his mind;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاهٍ</span></b> , (Fr, S,
TA, [but omitted in one of my copies of the S,])
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاهٌ</span></b> : (Fr, TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِجُوعِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاهٍ</span></b>  one <i>who
reveals his hunger;</i> originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَائِهٌ</span>, like as they
said <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَارٍ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَائِرٌ</span>. (TA.)

